    reqTestMapInfo	    "100 S'Requirement','ImplementLink','VerifyLink','ModelItem','Test','Simulation','modelItemMap'"
    "{{S1x12'Label','URL','ImplementInd','VerifyInd','FullID'{{T\"Upon initialization, the mission supervisor shall ini"
    "tialize its active mode and missionMode output to NormalInspection.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('linktype_rmi_slreq',"
    "'uav_mission_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','1','')\",M1x2[1 2],M[1],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_requirements:#1\"}"
    ",{T\"While the supervisor is in NormalInspection, if batteryPercent is valid and greater than Battery_Threshold_Lo"
    "w (25%) and routeComplete is false, the supervisor shall remain in NormalInspection.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('lin"
    "ktype_rmi_slreq','uav_mission_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','2','')\",M[3],M1x2[2 25],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_"
    "requirements:#2\"},{T\"While the supervisor is not in a terminal state, when batteryPercent is greater than Batter"
    "y_Threshold_Critical (10%) and less than or equal to Battery_Threshold_Low (25%), the supervisor shall enter or re"
    "main in ReturnToHome.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('linktype_rmi_slreq','uav_mission_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','"
    "3','')\",M1x2[4 5],M1x3[4 5 10],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_requirements:#3\"},{T\"While the supervisor is not in a "
    "terminal state, when batteryPercent is less than or equal to Battery_Threshold_Critical (10%), the supervisor shal"
    "l enter or remain in SafeLanding.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('linktype_rmi_slreq','uav_mission_supervisor_requiremen"
    "ts.slreqx','4','')\",M1x3[6 7 8],M1x4[6 8 12 27],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_requirements:#4\"},{T\"When batteryPerc"
    "ent is less than or equal to Battery_Threshold_Critical (10%), the supervisor shall select SafeLanding and shall n"
    "ot select ReturnToHome, even though the value is also below the low-battery threshold.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('l"
    "inktype_rmi_slreq','uav_mission_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','5','')\",M1x2[9 10],M1x4[7 9 13 28],T\"uav_missio"
    "n_supervisor_requirements:#5\"},{T\"When routeComplete is true and coincides with a low, critical, or invalid batt"
    "ery condition, the supervisor shall select the applicable battery safety response instead of MissionComplete.\",T\""
    "matlab:rmi.navigate('linktype_rmi_slreq','uav_mission_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','6','')\",M1x4[11 12 13 14],"
    "M1x6[11 14 16 18 20 32],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_requirements:#6\"},{T\"While the supervisor is in NormalInspecti"
    "on, when routeComplete is true and batteryPercent is valid and greater than Battery_Threshold_Low (25%), the super"
    "visor shall enter MissionComplete.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('linktype_rmi_slreq','uav_mission_supervisor_requireme"
    "nts.slreqx','7','')\",M1x2[15 16],M1x2[15 30],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_requirements:#7\"},{T\"Once the supervisor"
    " enters SafeLanding, it shall remain in SafeLanding for all subsequent input values.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('lin"
    "ktype_rmi_slreq','uav_mission_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','8','')\",M[17],M[23],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_requ"
    "irements:#8\"},{T\"Once the supervisor enters MissionComplete, it shall remain in MissionComplete for all subseque"
    "nt input values.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('linktype_rmi_slreq','uav_mission_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','9',''"
    ")\",M[18],M[24],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_requirements:#9\"},{T\"Once the supervisor enters ReturnToHome, it shall"
    " not return to NormalInspection or transition to MissionComplete; it shall remain in ReturnToHome unless a critica"
    "l or invalid battery input requires escalation to SafeLanding.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('linktype_rmi_slreq','uav_"
    "mission_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','10','')\",M1x3[19 20 21],M1x2[22 35],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_requiremen"
    "ts:#10\"},{T\"If batteryPercent is non-finite, below 0%, or above 100%, then the supervisor shall enter SafeLandin"
    "g, unless it is already in another approved terminal state.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('linktype_rmi_slreq','uav_mis"
    "sion_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','11','')\",M1x3[22 23 24],M1x5[17 19 21 33 36],T\"uav_mission_supervisor_requ"
    "irements:#11\"},{T\"For every active state and input combination, the mission supervisor shall produce exactly one"
    " deterministic next state and a missionMode value corresponding to that state.\",T\"matlab:rmi.navigate('linktype_"
    "rmi_slreq','uav_mission_supervisor_requirements.slreqx','12','')\",M1x5[25 26 27 28 29],M1x5[3 26 29 31 34],T\"uav"
    "_mission_supervisor_requirements:#12\"}},S1x29'RequirementIdx','ModelItemIdx'{{M[1],M[1]},{M[1],M[2]},{M[2],M[2]},"
